{"product_id":"charmfall-a-novel-of-the-dark-elite","title":"Charmfall: A Novel of the Dark Elite","description":"\u003cp\u003eBook Description High school can be a battlefield, but for Lily Parker, surviving at St. Sophia's School for Girls is a matter of life and death' --This text refers to the Hardcover edition. Product Description Protecting Chicago from the dark side can be an exhausting job, especially when you're a sophomore. So when the girls of St. Sophia's start gearing up for Sneak, their fall formal, Lily decides to join in on some good, old-fashioned party prep - even if it means not giving demons, vampires and the twisted magic users known as Reapers her undivided attention. But when a Reaper infiltrates the school, Lily doesn't forget what she's sworn to protect. She reaches deep into herself to draw out her magic - and finds that it's gone. And it turns out she's not alone. A magical blackout has slammed through paranormal Chicago, and no one knows what - or who - caused it. But Lily knows getting back her magic is worth the risk of going behind enemy lines ... About the Author Chloe Neill was born in the south of\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 135 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Chloe Neill\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781780620626\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 256\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45204295418009,"sku":"7RF9781780620626","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67cb1738eff3f_Charmfall-_20A_20Novel_20of_20the_20Dark_20Elite_20Chloe_20Neill.jpg?v=1752084552","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/charmfall-a-novel-of-the-dark-elite","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}